{
  "readme": "# Tricky Addon - Update Target List\n\nConfigure TrickyStore via KSU WebUI.\n\n[![GitHub Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List?logo=github&label=Release)](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/releases/latest)\n[![Pre Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List?include_prereleases&logo=github&label=Pre-release)](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/releases)\n[![Nightly Release](https://img.shields.io/badge/Nightly-canary_build-640064?logo=githubactions&logoColor=fff)](https://nightly.link/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/workflows/build/main?preview)\n[![Crowdin](https://img.shields.io/badge/Localization-Crowdin-palegreen?logo=Crowdin)](https://crowdin.com/project/TA_utl)\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This module is **not** a part of the Tricky Store module. DO NOT report any issues to Tricky Store if encountered.\n\n## Requirements\n\nInstall any of the following:\n\n- [TrickyStore](https://github.com/5ec1cff/TrickyStore)\n- [TEESimulator](https://github.com/JingMatrix/TEESimulator)\n- [OhMyKeymint](https://github.com/qwq233/OhMyKeymint)\n\n## Instructions\n\n### KernelSU & Apatch\n\n- Built-in WebUI\n\n### Magisk\n\n- Action button to open WebUI\n- Support [KSUWebUIStandalone](https://github.com/KOWX712/KsuWebUIStandalone) and [WebUI X](https://github.com/MMRLApp/WebUI-X-Portable)\n- Automatic KSUWebUIStandalone install if none of them are installed.\n\n## Features\n\n- Config target list, mode, security patch and keybox.\n- View 'Help' menu in WebUI for more info.\n\n## Localization\n- Read [Translation Guide](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/blob/main/webui/public/locales/GUIDE.md)\n\n## Links\n[![release](https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-Download-F25278?style=for-the-badge&logo=download&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/releases)\n[![issue](https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-Open%20Issue-palegreen?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=black&logo=issue-opened)](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/issues)\n[![changelog](https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-Update%20History-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=history&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/blob/main/changelog.md)\n[![Telegram](https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-KOW's%20little%20world-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white)](https://t.me/kowchannel)\n",
  "readmeHTML": "<h1>Tricky Addon - Update Target List</h1>\n\n<p>Configure TrickyStore via KSU WebUI.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List?logo=github&label=Release\">![GitHub Release</a>](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/releases/latest)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List?include_prereleases&logo=github&label=Pre-release\">![Pre Release</a>](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/releases)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Nightly-canary_build-640064?logo=githubactions&logoColor=fff\">![Nightly Release</a>](https://nightly.link/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/workflows/build/main?preview)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Localization-Crowdin-palegreen?logo=Crowdin\">![Crowdin</a>](https://crowdin.com/project/TA_utl)</p>\n\n<p>> [!WARNING]</p>\n<p>> This module is <b>not</b> a part of the Tricky Store module. DO NOT report any issues to Tricky Store if encountered.</p>\n\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n\n<p>Install any of the following:</p>\n\n<li>[TrickyStore](https://github.com/5ec1cff/TrickyStore)</li>\n<li>[TEESimulator](https://github.com/JingMatrix/TEESimulator)</li>\n<li>[OhMyKeymint](https://github.com/qwq233/OhMyKeymint)</li>\n\n<h2>Instructions</h2>\n\n<h3>KernelSU & Apatch</h3>\n\n<li>Built-in WebUI</li>\n\n<h3>Magisk</h3>\n\n<li>Action button to open WebUI</li>\n<li>Support [KSUWebUIStandalone](https://github.com/KOWX712/KsuWebUIStandalone) and [WebUI X](https://github.com/MMRLApp/WebUI-X-Portable)</li>\n<li>Automatic KSUWebUIStandalone install if none of them are installed.</li>\n\n<h2>Features</h2>\n\n<li>Config target list, mode, security patch and keybox.</li>\n<li>View 'Help' menu in WebUI for more info.</li>\n\n<h2>Localization</h2>\n<li>Read [Translation Guide](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/blob/main/webui/public/locales/GUIDE.md)</li>\n\n<h2>Links</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-Download-F25278?style=for-the-badge&logo=download&logoColor=white\">![release</a>](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/releases)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-Open%20Issue-palegreen?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=black&logo=issue-opened\">![issue</a>](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/issues)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-Update%20History-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=history&logoColor=white\">![changelog</a>](https://github.com/KOWX712/Tricky-Addon-Update-Target-List/blob/main/changelog.md)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/-KOW's%20little%20world-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white\">![Telegram</a>](https://t.me/kowchannel)</p>",
